    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an electrifying journey where <strong>roguelike strategy</strong> meets the thrill of <strong>tower defense</strong>. <strong>Deva - Rise of Demons</strong> invites you to a mythical island under siege, where your ultimate mission is to defend the <strong>sacred Energy Core</strong> at the heart of the battlefield. With waves of enemies surging from three distinct paths, you must harness your wits, strategy, and the unique powers of legendary heroes to secure victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Content Overview for <i>Deva - Rise of Demons</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397540/extras/22d0e80f4ae028d68371e6af43e21179.avif?t=1736818894\" data-has-big width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can select one of four heroes (<i>Devas</i>) to play: <strong>Vessavana, Ganesha, Amaterasu,</strong> or <strong>Vishnu</strong>. Each hero possesses unique skills and abilities, offering diverse gameplay experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397540/extras/11de4d01c711273cd8720ccf6c2a424a.avif?t=1736818894\" data-has-big width=800 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Play One Island (Aetheris Sanctum)</strong>: Battle through <strong>10 enemy waves</strong> on this challenging island. Enemies will attack from three directions, with increasing difficulty as waves progress. At the final wave, face a <strong>powerful boss enemy</strong> to test your skills and strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Strategic Defense</strong>: Plan and prepare carefully to protect your towers and energy core from relentless assaults.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397540/extras/bcf304f1dfceb107f40abf921fd92305.avif?t=1736818894\" data-has-big width=800 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Collect Experience Points</strong>: Enemies drop green energy orbs when defeated. Collect these to level up and enhance your hero\u2019s abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397540/extras/56f15ad3fd60cce8737d4c5829c07bbc.avif?t=1736818894\" data-has-big width=800 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Item Boxes</strong>: Randomly appearing item boxes provide valuable tools, such as damage boosts or health/mana regeneration, to aid in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game gives you an exciting preview of <i>Deva - Rise of Demons</i>, showcasing core gameplay mechanics, strategic challenges, and unique hero abilities.  <br>  <br>    </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an electrifying journey where <strong>roguelike strategy</strong> meets the thrill of <strong>tower defense</strong>. <strong>Deva - Rise of Demons</strong> invites you to a mythical island under siege, where your ultimate mission is to defend the <strong>sacred Energy Core</strong> at the heart of the battlefield. With waves of enemies surging from three distinct paths, you must harness your wits, strategy, and the unique powers of legendary heroes to secure victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Content Overview for <i>Deva - Rise of Demons</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397540/extras/22d0e80f4ae028d68371e6af43e21179.avif?t=1736818894\" data-has-big width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can select one of four heroes (<i>Devas</i>) to play: <strong>Vessavana, Ganesha, Amaterasu,</strong> or <strong>Vishnu</strong>. Each hero possesses unique skills and abilities, offering diverse gameplay experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397540/extras/11de4d01c711273cd8720ccf6c2a424a.avif?t=1736818894\" data-has-big width=800 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Play One Island (Aetheris Sanctum)</strong>: Battle through <strong>10 enemy waves</strong> on this challenging island. Enemies will attack from three directions, with increasing difficulty as waves progress. At the final wave, face a <strong>powerful boss enemy</strong> to test your skills and strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Strategic Defense</strong>: Plan and prepare carefully to protect your towers and energy core from relentless assaults.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397540/extras/bcf304f1dfceb107f40abf921fd92305.avif?t=1736818894\" data-has-big width=800 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Collect Experience Points</strong>: Enemies drop green energy orbs when defeated. Collect these to level up and enhance your hero\u2019s abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397540/extras/56f15ad3fd60cce8737d4c5829c07bbc.avif?t=1736818894\" data-has-big width=800 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Item Boxes</strong>: Randomly appearing item boxes provide valuable tools, such as damage boosts or health/mana regeneration, to aid in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game gives you an exciting preview of <i>Deva - Rise of Demons</i>, showcasing core gameplay mechanics, strategic challenges, and unique hero abilities.  <br>  <br>    </p>",
